WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.667
Start at a peg. Keep one foot here and move the other until the string finds level.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:08.375
Check the mark.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.708
Peg this spot.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:18.417
Keep that foot planted. Swing the other foot around. Check level, then peg again.

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:24.458
Now hold the newly found point. The other foot searches across the slope.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:30.667
Once the string settles at level, place the next peg.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:35.792
Follow the pegs. Each marks a point at the same height.
